w0(px,py)=(x2-x1)*(py-y1)-(y2-y1)*(px-x1)  // weight of vertex 0
w1(px,py)=(x0-x2)*(py-y2)-(y0-y2)*(px-x2)  // weight of vertex 1
w2(px,py)=(x1-x0)*(py-y0)-(y1-y0)*(px-x0)  // weight of vertex 2
