5) Moving light: la=simTime*0.9; lightPos=[CENTER[0]+Math.cos(la)*3.4, 1.3+Math.sin(simTime*1.3)*1.5, CENTER[2]+Math.sin(la)*3.4];
6) Per-vertex Lambert intensity: N=norm3(sub3(world[v],CENTER)); L=norm3(sub3(lightPos,world[v])); lam=Math.max(0,dot3(N,L)); IV[v]=0.22+0.78*lam; // ambient 0.22
