8) For each face i in 0..5, for each of its 2 triangles (a,b,c indices): BACKFACE CULL first: n=cross(sub3(world[b],world[a]),sub3(world[c],world[a])); cx=(world[a][0]+world[b][0]+world[c][0])/3; cy,cz same; if(dot3(n,[cx,cy,cz])&gt;=0)skip; // camera at origin so view vector to face IS the centroid; visible iff dot&lt;0. Also skip if any of (-world[k][2])&lt;0.1 for k in a,b,c (near-plane guard).
