13) HUD text: ctx.font=Math.round(13*dpr)+'px ui-monospace, Consolas, monospace'; ctx.textBaseline='top';
   line1 at (10*dpr,8*dpr) fillStyle '#8fa8c8': 'Gouraud cube - Canvas 2D software rasterizer'
   line2 at (10*dpr,(8+20)*dpr) fillStyle '#8dffb0': 'FPS: '+fpsValue.toFixed(1)
   line3 at (10*dpr,(8+40)*dpr) fillStyle '#cfe3ff': '[W] wireframe: '+(wireframe?'ON':'off')+'   [P] pause: '+(paused?'ON':'off')
   Also top-right corner (textAlign='right', x=W-10*dpr,y=8*dpr, fillStyle '#68789a'): 'drag not supported - keys only' — SKIP this line, not needed.

SECTION 6 input & main loop:
window.addEventListener('keydown',e=&gt;{const k=e.key.toLowerCase();if(k==='w')wireframe=!wireframe;else if(k==='p')paused=!paused;});
function frame(now){const dtReal=(now-lastT)/1000;lastT=now;fpsFrames++;fpsAccum+=dtReal;if(fpsAccum&gt;=0.5){fpsValue=fpsFrames/fpsAccum;fpsFrames=0;fpsAccum=0;}if(!paused)simTime+=Math.min(dtReal,0.05);render(now);requestAnimationFrame(frame);}
NOTE: do the dt/simTime update ONLY in frame() as above; render() must NOT update lastT or simTime itself (remove that from render; render is pure drawing based on simTime).
resize(); requestAnimationFrame(frame);

